NTENANCE MANUAL 32-42-09. ACCOMPLISHED BRAKE SYSTEM BLEEDING IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE MANUAL 32-44-00. SERVICED GEAR AND BRAKE PNEUMATIC BOTTLE IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE 12-13-01. OPERATIONAL AND LEAK CHECKS GOOD. RESET BRAKE SHUTTLE VALVE IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE MANUAL 32-42-09. ACCOMPLISHED BRAKE SYSTEM BLEEDING IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE MANUAL 32-44-00. SERVICED GEAR AND BRAKE PNEUMATIC BOTTLE IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE 12-13-01. OPERATIONAL AND LEAK CHECKS GOOD. REPLACE POWER BRAKE CIRCUIT BREAKER PART NUMBER S2899L15.0 IDENTIFIER HC113 REMOVED OLD POWER BRAKE CIRCUIT BREAKER REFDES HC113, REMOVED P/N: S2899L15.0 REMOVED S/N: N/A. INSTALLED NEW CIRCUIT BREAKER, INSTALLED P/N: S2899L15.0 INSTALLED S/N: N/A, IAW CE560XL MAINTENANCE MANUAL 24-50-02. INSTALLED PART PROVIDED BY NETJETS.</td></tr>
